From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 11:02:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v4l2-compliance: detect the cedrus
 VC-1/MPEG-4/H.263/Spark/AVS/AVS2 stateless decoders

determine_codec_mask() returns without setting a codec mask as soon as it
meets a compressed output format it does not know. The Orange Pi Zero2
kernel's cedrus offers six stateless formats that are not in mainline
yet (SVC1, MG4S, S263, SPKS, AVS2, AVSF), so the node was tested as a
non-codec device and VIDIOC_(TRY_)DECODER_CMD failed the stateful rules
("v4l2-test-codecs.cpp(161): ret").

List them as stateless decoder formats, with local fourcc definitions
until the uAPI is in videodev2.h.

Not for upstream as is: drop the local defines and resend with the
kernel uAPI series.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 utils/v4l2-compliance/v4l2-compliance.cpp | 30 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 30 insertions(+)

diff --git a/utils/v4l2-compliance/v4l2-compliance.cpp b/utils/v4l2-compliance/v4l2-compliance.cpp
index b82d7da..14f9c98 100644
--- a/utils/v4l2-compliance/v4l2-compliance.cpp
+++ b/utils/v4l2-compliance/v4l2-compliance.cpp
@@ -31,6 +31,30 @@
 #include <unistd.h>
 
 #include "v4l2-compliance.h"
+
+/*
+ * Stateless decoder formats of the Orange Pi Zero2 (cedrus) kernel uAPI that
+ * are not in mainline videodev2.h yet. Without them an unknown compressed
+ * format ends the codec detection and the node is tested as stateful.
+ */
+#ifndef V4L2_PIX_FMT_VC1_SLICE
+#define V4L2_PIX_FMT_VC1_SLICE		v4l2_fourcc('S', 'V', 'C', '1')
+#endif
+#ifndef V4L2_PIX_FMT_MPEG4_SLICE
+#define V4L2_PIX_FMT_MPEG4_SLICE	v4l2_fourcc('M', 'G', '4', 'S')
+#endif
+#ifndef V4L2_PIX_FMT_H263_SLICE
+#define V4L2_PIX_FMT_H263_SLICE		v4l2_fourcc('S', '2', '6', '3')
+#endif
+#ifndef V4L2_PIX_FMT_SPK_SLICE
+#define V4L2_PIX_FMT_SPK_SLICE		v4l2_fourcc('S', 'P', 'K', 'S')
+#endif
+#ifndef V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS2_FRAME
+#define V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS2_FRAME		v4l2_fourcc('A', 'V', 'S', '2')
+#endif
+#ifndef V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS_FRAME
+#define V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS_FRAME		v4l2_fourcc('A', 'V', 'S', 'F')
+#endif
 #include <media-info.h>
 #include <v4l-getsubopt.h>
 
@@ -595,6 +619,12 @@ static void determine_codec_mask(struct node &node)
 			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_VP9_FRAME:
 			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_AV1_FRAME:
 			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_FWHT_STATELESS:
+			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_VC1_SLICE:
+			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_MPEG4_SLICE:
+			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_H263_SLICE:
+			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_SPK_SLICE:
+			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS2_FRAME:
+			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS_FRAME:
 				mask |= STATELESS_DECODER;
 				break;
 			default:
